Genotype → Pathway → Protein → Cell Type → Therapeutic Target

DNA mutation
   ↓
Bulk RNA pathway activation
   ↓
Candidate surface genes (surfaceome)
   ↓
Proteomics confirmation (protein present)
   ↓
scRNA validation (tumor-specific expression)
   ↓
Causal mediation testing
   ↓
Rank therapeutic surface antigens

Step 0: Inputs
Step 1 — Driver Pathway
Step 2 — Surface Genes Present in Data
Step 3 — Bulk RNA Association  
3.1 Correlation with pathway
3.2 Differential expression (high vs low pathway)
Step 4 — Proteomics Confirmation
Step 5 — scRNA-seq Processing
Step 6 — Tumor-Specific Expression
Step 7 — Detection Rate in Tumor Cells  Important for CAR-T/ADC targets.
Step 8 — Mediation Analysis  Mutation → Pathway → Surface Gene
Step 9 — Combine All Evidence
Step 10 — Therapeutic Ranking Score


Step 0: Inputs
rna_df            → Sample × Gene
pathway_scores    → Sample × Pathway
mutation_df       → Sample × Gene
protein_df        → Sample × Protein abundance
scrna_counts      → Cell × Gene
cell_metadata     → Cell × {sample_id, cell_type}
surface_gene_list → Known surface proteins

Step 1 — Driver Pathway
driver_pathway = "MAPK_SIGNALING"
y = pathway_scores[driver_pathway]

Step 2 — Surface Genes Present in Data
surface_genes = [
    g for g in surface_gene_list
    if g in rna_df.columns
]

Step 3 — Bulk RNA Association  
3.1 Correlation with pathway

import pandas as pd
corr_df = pd.DataFrame({
    g: rna_df[g].corr(y)
    for g in surface_genes
}, index=["corr"]).T

3.2 Differential expression (high vs low pathway)
from scipy.stats import ttest_ind

high = y > y.quantile(0.75)
low  = y < y.quantile(0.25)

de_results = []

for g in surface_genes:
    t, p = ttest_ind(
        rna_df.loc[high, g],
        rna_df.loc[low, g],
        nan_policy="omit"
    )
    de_results.append((g, t, p))

de_df = pd.DataFrame(
    de_results,
    columns=["gene", "t_stat", "p_value"]
).set_index("gene")

Step 4 — Proteomics Confirmation
prot_genes = protein_df.columns.intersection(surface_genes)

prot_corr = pd.DataFrame({
    g: protein_df[g].corr(y)
    for g in prot_genes
}, index=["prot_corr"]).T

Optional: require minimum abundance
prot_abundance = protein_df.mean()
prot_abundance = prot_abundance.loc[prot_genes]

Step 5 — scRNA-seq Processing
import scanpy as sc

adata = sc.AnnData(scrna_counts)
adata.obs = cell_metadata

sc.pp.normalize_total(adata)
sc.pp.log1p(adata)

Step 6 — Tumor-Specific Expression
#Compute mean expression per cell type.

expr_by_celltype = (
    pd.DataFrame(
        adata.X,
        columns=adata.var_names
    )
    .groupby(adata.obs["cell_type"])
    .mean()
)

# Assume tumor cell label = "Tumor"

tumor_expr = expr_by_celltype.loc["Tumor"]
normal_expr = expr_by_celltype.drop("Tumor").mean()

# Tumor specificity score:

tumor_specificity = (
    tumor_expr[surface_genes] -
    normal_expr[surface_genes]
)

Step 7 — Detection Rate in Tumor Cells  Important for CAR-T/ADC targets.
tumor_cells = adata[adata.obs["cell_type"] == "Tumor"]

detect_rate = (
    (tumor_cells.X > 0)
    .mean(axis=0)
)

detect_rate = pd.Series(
    detect_rate,
    index=adata.var_names
).loc[surface_genes]

Step 8 — Mediation Analysis  Mutation → Pathway → Surface Gene
import statsmodels.api as sm

mutation_gene = "KRAS"
X_mut = mutation_df[mutation_gene]

med_results = []

for g in surface_genes:

    model = sm.OLS(
        rna_df[g],
        sm.add_constant(
            pd.concat([X_mut, y], axis=1)
        )
    ).fit()

    med_results.append({
        "gene": g,
        "pathway_coef": model.params[y.name],
        "p_med": model.pvalues[y.name]
    })

med_df = pd.DataFrame(med_results).set_index("gene")

Step 9 — Combine All Evidence
final = (
    corr_df
    .join(de_df)
    .join(prot_corr)
    .join(prot_abundance.rename("prot_abundance"))
    .join(tumor_specificity.rename("tumor_specificity"))
    .join(detect_rate.rename("detect_rate"))
    .join(med_df)
)

Step 10 — Therapeutic Ranking Score
import numpy as np

final["score"] = (
    abs(final["corr"]) *
    abs(final["prot_corr"]) *
    final["tumor_specificity"] *
    final["detect_rate"] *
    -np.log10(final["p_med"] + 1e-8)
)

final = final.sort_values("score", ascending=False)






